ple swimming pools, this sale marks a record-breaking residential deal in the Caribbean, as Willis actively streamlines his property portfolio.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2000-bruce-willis-bought-7-3-acres-on-parrot-cay-over-four-years-he-built-three-homes-four-pools-and-a-beachfront-yoga-pavilion-before-selling-the-caribbean-compound-for-27-million-in-2019/articleshow/134546608.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/in-2000-bruce-willis-bought-7-3-acres-on-parrot-cay-over-four-years-he-built-three-homes-four-pools-and-a-beachfront-yoga-pavilion-before-selling-the-caribbean-compound-for-27-million-in-2019/articleshow/134546608.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-28T21:31:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134546751,imgsize-2358712.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[I had independence, routine, and a sense that I was moving forward: Ex-NRI shares struggle adjusting in India after spending years in US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134546139.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/nri/i-had-independence-routine-and-a-sense-that-i-was-moving-forward-ex-nri-shares-struggle-adjusting-in-india-after-spending-years-in-us/articleshow/134546139.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/nri/i-had-independence-routine-and-a-sense-that-i-was-moving-forward-ex-nri-shares-struggle-adjusting-in-india-after-spending-years-in-us/articleshow/134546139.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-28T20:46:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134546153,imgsize-125138.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2003, Sean and Melodye Rooney bought Montana land; 23 years later, their 57 acres were protected]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134539506.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Rooney family has taken a significant step to protect their 57-acre Montana property by establishing a conservation easement. This binding agreement ensures that the land cannot be subdivided or developed in the future, preserving its rich variety of habitats and supporting many wildlife species. Their deep-rooted connection to this land motivated their choice to maintain its ecological health, ensuring it remains a working property while protecting its natural beauty.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2003-sean-and-melodye-rooney-bought-montana-land-beside-the-stillwater-river-23-years-later-their-57-acre-property-with-nearly-a-mile-of-river-frontage-became-permanently-protected-from-development/articleshow/134539506.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2003-sean-and-melodye-rooney-bought-montana-land-beside-the-stillwater-river-23-years-later-their-57-acre-property-with-nearly-a-mile-of-river-frontage-became-permanently-protected-from-development/articleshow/134539506.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-29T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134539720,imgsize-2336169.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Minnesota couple expands 20 acres into 655-acre Montana conservation haven]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134539540.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/wo